---
/**
 * The translation between the engineering and business vocabularies, from
 * `/value` 3.1, as inline SVG so it follows the design tokens.
 *
 * Both nodes are deliberately vocabulary rather than values: a concrete figure
 * like "0.4% / year" would read as a measurement this page has not earned.
 *
 * The diagram makes three claims from the prose, in order of importance:
 * the two vocabularies do not meet (the dashed gap), the backwards direction
 * is the useful one (accent), and the gap is where the money is lost (signal).
 * Marker ids are prefixed because ids are document-global.
 */
---

<svg
  class="vocab"
  viewBox="0 0 660 250"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="vocab-title vocab-desc"
  preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"
>
  <title id="vocab-title">The gap between a verdict and a rate</title>
  <desc id="vocab-desc">
    Two boxes with a gap between them. On the left, where engineering conversations end, a verdict:
    pass or fail. On the right, where business conversations start, a return rate. Two arrows cross
    the gap. Reading forward from verdict to rate is the common direction; working backwards from an
    acceptable rate to what the test must detect is marked as the useful direction. A note points
    into the gap: almost every expensive hardware mistake happens there.
  </desc>

  <defs>
    <marker
      id="vocab-arrow-muted"
      viewBox="0 0 8 8"
      refX="7"
      refY="4"
      markerWidth="7"
      markerHeight="7"
      orient="auto-start-reverse"
    >
      <path d="M 0.5 1 L 7 4 L 0.5 7" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-muted)" stroke-width="1.3" />
    </marker>
    <marker
      id="vocab-arrow-accent"
      viewBox="0 0 8 8"
      refX="7"
      refY="4"
      markerWidth="7"
      markerHeight="7"
      orient="auto-start-reverse"
    >
      <path d="M 0.5 1 L 7 4 L 0.5 7" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.3" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <!-- the two vocabularies -->
  <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" letter-spacing="1.4" fill="var(--ink-muted)">
    <text x="40" y="64">ENGINEERING ENDS HERE</text>
    <text x="410" y="64">BUSINESS STARTS HERE</text>
  </g>

  <rect
    x="40"
    y="80"
    width="210"
    height="60"
    fill="none"
    stroke="var(--rule-strong)"
    stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
  <text
    x="145"
    y="118"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="19"
    letter-spacing="1.5"
    fill="var(--ink)">PASS / FAIL</text
  >

  <rect
    x="410"
    y="80"
    width="210"
    height="60"
    fill="none"
    stroke="var(--rule-strong)"
    stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
  <text
    x="515"
    y="118"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="19"
    letter-spacing="1.5"
    fill="var(--ink)">RETURN RATE</text
  >

  <!-- the gap they do not meet across -->
  <g stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4">
    <line x1="250" y1="52" x2="250" y2="168" />
    <line x1="410" y1="52" x2="410" y2="168" />
  </g>

  <text
    x="330"
    y="44"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="10"
    letter-spacing="1.4"
    fill="var(--ink-muted)">TRANSLATION</text
  >

  <line
    x1="262"
    y1="100"
    x2="398"
    y2="100"
    stroke="var(--ink-muted)"
    stroke-width="1.3"
    marker-end="url(#vocab-arrow-muted)"></line>
  <line
    x1="398"
    y1="126"
    x2="262"
    y2="126"
    stroke="var(--accent)"
    stroke-width="1.3"
    marker-end="url(#vocab-arrow-accent)"></line>
  <text
    x="330"
    y="160"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="10"
    letter-spacing="1.4"
    fill="var(--accent)">USEFUL DIRECTION</text
  >

  <!-- where the money goes -->
  <line
    x1="330"
    y1="176"
    x2="330"
    y2="200"
    stroke="var(--signal)"
    stroke-width="1"
    stroke-dasharray="3 4"></line>
  <text
    x="330"
    y="220"
    text-anchor="middle"
    font-family="var(--font-mono)"
    font-size="11"
    letter-spacing="1.2"
    fill="var(--signal)">ALMOST EVERY EXPENSIVE MISTAKE HAPPENS IN HERE</text
  >
</svg>

<style>
  .vocab {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
